  "description": "After his first drama flopped, Lee Hyunseok gave up on being a PD. But when he finds himself being granted one last wish in his dying moments, he wants only one thing: to produce the ultimate makjang drama. Now, he’s been given a second shot at life (and the assistance of a ghostly PD), but he’s on a time crunch to achieve ratings and recognition. With no budget, rookie actors, and an amateur writer, Hyunseok’s got his work cut out for him. But what’s a good drama without a few twists and turns? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
